    "html": "<div class=\"uilib-comp uilib-official-ssr\"><div class=\"w-full divide-y divide-border rounded-lg border border-border bg-card px-3 w-full\"><div class=\"py-2.5\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"flex w-full items-center justify-between text-left text-xs font-semibold text-foreground gap-2\"><span>What is Base UI?</span>\n<svg\n  class=\"lucide shrink-0 inline-block text-muted-foreground shrink-0\"\n  xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"\n  width=\"14\"\n  height=\"14\"\n  viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"\n  fill=\"none\"\n  stroke=\"currentColor\"\n  stroke-width=\"2\"\n  stroke-linecap=\"round\"\n  stroke-linejoin=\"round\"\n>\n  <path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\" />\n</svg>\n</button><div class=\"pt-1.5 text-xs text-muted-foreground\">Base UI is a library of high-quality unstyled React components for design systems and web apps.</div></div><div class=\"py-2.5\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"flex w-full items-center justify-between text-left text-xs font-semibold text-foreground gap-2\"><span>How do I get started?</span>\n<svg\n  class=\"lucide shrink-0 inline-block text-muted-foreground shrink-0\"\n  xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"\n  width=\"14\"\n  height=\"14\"\n  viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"\n  fill=\"none\"\n  stroke=\"currentColor\"\n  stroke-width=\"2\"\n  stroke-linecap=\"round\"\n  stroke-linejoin=\"round\"\n>\n  <path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\" />\n</svg>\n</button><div class=\"pt-1.5 text-xs text-muted-foreground\">Head to the &quot;Quick start&quot; guide in the docs. If you've used unstyled libraries before, you'll feel at home.</div></div><div class=\"py-2.5\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"flex w-full items-center justify-between text-left text-xs font-semibold text-foreground gap-2\"><span>Can I use it for my project?</span>\n<svg\n  class=\"lucide shrink-0 inline-block text-muted-foreground shrink-0\"\n  xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"\n  width=\"14\"\n  height=\"14\"\n  viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"\n  fill=\"none\"\n  stroke=\"currentColor\"\n  stroke-width=\"2\"\n  stroke-linecap=\"round\"\n  stroke-linejoin=\"round\"\n>\n  <path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\" />\n</svg>\n</button><div class=\"pt-1.5 text-xs text-muted-foreground\">Of course! Base UI is free and open source.</div></div></div></div>"
