    "html": "<div class=\"uilib-comp uilib-official-ssr\"><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-indigo-500/30 bg-zinc-950 p-4 text-center\"><h1 class=\"text-2xl px-4 md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-neutral-700 dark:text-white max-w-4xl leading-relaxed lg:leading-snug text-center mx-auto \">With insomnia, nothing's real. Everything is far away. Everything is a <span class=\"rounded-md bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-500 to-purple-500 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-white\">copy, of a copy, of a copy.</span></h1></div></div>"
